Accept: application/json

###

### Get upcoming obligations (next 30 days)
GET {{Financial.Api_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/upcoming-obligations?currency=PYG
Accept: application/json

###

### Get upcoming obligations (current month)
GET {{Financial.Api_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/upcoming-obligations?startDate=2026-08-01&endDate=2026-08-31&currency=PYG
Accept: application/json

