# ================================================
# PHASE 7: RAG - Document Management & Search
# ================================================

### Get all documents
GET {{Financial.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents
Accept: application/json

###

### Upload a text document
POST {{Financial.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Financial Strategy 2026
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

My personal financial strategy and goals for 2026
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

Report
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="strategy.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

This is my financial strategy for 2026:

1. Save 30% of monthly income
2. Reduce dining out expenses by 20%
3. Invest in index funds monthly
4. Build emergency fund of 6 months expenses
5. Pay off credit card debt completely
6. Review and optimize subscriptions quarterly

Target net worth growth: 25% by end of year
Focus on passive income generation
Automate savings and investments
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### Get document by ID (replace {documentId} with actual ID)
GET {{Financial.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/{documentId}
Accept: application/json

###

### Update document
PUT {{Financial.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/{documentId}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Financial Strategy 2026",
  "description": "Updated strategy with Q2 adjustments"
}

###

### Search documents by content
POST {{Financial.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "savings and investment strategy",
  "limit": 5
}

###

### Force reprocess a document (if needed)
POST {{Financial.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/{documentId}/process
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Delete document
DELETE {{Financial.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/{documentId}

###

